# Mechanical: what a machine writes for any contract. Complete and visible, and not pleasant.

SCREEN Home ABOUT Alice:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Alice: identity, person
    LIST People: EVERYONE WITH knows, friend, member, listed, message, posted, group_delivered, group_message OPENS Person
    LIST Leader: "Alice is the leader of Grupo"
    Establish: Alice may establish an identity
    Acquaint: Alice and Bob may jointly come to know each other, Bob TYPED
    Introduce: Alice may introduce Carol to Bob, Bob FROM knows, Carol FROM knows
    Befriend: Alice and Bob may jointly become friends, Bob FROM knows
    Unfriend: Alice may end her friendship with Bob, Bob FROM friend
    Message: Alice may send Text to Bob, Bob FROM friend, Text TYPED
    Create: Alice may create Grupo, Grupo TYPED
    Close: Alice may close Grupo by leaving it, Grupo FROM leader
    Join: Alice may add Bob to Grupo, Bob FROM friend, Grupo FROM leader
    Remove: Alice may end Bob's membership in Grupo, Bob FROM listed, Grupo FROM leader
    Leave: Alice may end her membership in Bob's Grupo, Bob FROM member, Grupo FROM member
    Post: Alice may send Text to the group Grupo of Bob, Bob FROM member, Text TYPED, Grupo FROM member
    Post own: Alice may send Text to the group Grupo of Alice, Text TYPED, Grupo FROM member

SCREEN Person ABOUT Bob:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Bob: knows, friend, member, listed, message, posted, group_delivered, group_message
